    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Relate particle incorporation probabilities to particle size, shape, chemistry and measured interfacial energies in time-lapse observations of shell building. A surface-energy model must predict selectivity and assembly without organismal transport behavior better than active-choice models.";
